		<node type="event_simple" id="38" tag="">
			<journal_entry>These things always sound so easy when you say them...</journal_entry>
		</node>
		<node type="event_simple" id="39" tag="">
			<journal_entry>The level of chaos and confusion coming out of the Darkbrood was palpable, even to you.  It was now time to strike at the Doombringer! All you needed to do, apparently, was to confront him and survive awhile!</journal_entry>
		</node>
